    {
      "_id": "QgQhffgSVcGRqy5z",
      "name": "Change Shape",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The drake can magically polymorph into a humanoid or back into its true form. Its humanoid form always appears to be sickly and half-rotted. It reverts to its true form if it dies. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying is absorbed or borne by the new form (its choice).\n\nIn a new form, the drake retains its alignment, hit points, ability to speak, proficiencies, and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores, as well as this action.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
